    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n13684" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀποσῐωπ-άω</span></b> , <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>maintain silence,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Isoc.
				12.215
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Plb.
				30.19.9
			</span></i>, etc.; <i>cease speaking and be silent,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μεταξὺ λέγων ἀ.</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Plu.
					<u>Alc.</u>
					10
				</span></i>
			; as a rhetorical figure (cf. sq.), <i><span class="en">
				Demetr.
				<u>Eloc.</u>
				44
			</span></i>,<i><span class="en">
				253
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b> trans.,
				<i>keep secret,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὄνομα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Luc.
					<u>Pseudol.</u>
					21
				</span></i>
			; <i>leave unsaid,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Id.
				<u>Pisc.</u>
				29
			</span></i>; <i>leave unnoticed,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				POxy.
				237 vii 24
			</span></i>
			<span class="entity">(ii A.D.)</span>.</div>
